 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-18","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.88","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.88/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"d4ecd057dbadc813b525255e2e3e51e9ba2ed8ea8e7c71f1a3fc18935c6afd83"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.88/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"bf422f2a017fd18e541294ceb6fa6b2497458f861e3ba48d6b64874329e466b5"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.88/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"74dd40ca74030f5c99bf8f06fd8b8aa2fad3139ea6ad788dbfeff6b615ad38d9"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.88/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"9da7e62e471cb39dd3c35ccbfd3522617f15f0666d62e8f2735d0f23b59e309a"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.88"}